{
  "id": "ss.char.tri",
  "name": "Tri",
  "description": "The fast one, and the one with its mouth full. Aqua hair swept back into spikes, a scarf streaming off the neck, the thinnest limbs of the eight, and a face caught mid-gulp: the near cheek puffed out round and shining, the mouth pursed to a dot, both eyes narrowed with the effort of holding it — because what Tri does is spit, and it is always about to. The wedge it used to be is the wedge its hair makes now. Same dead organ as the rest, worn as a brooch; same bobble feelers, laid flatter than the others' because it is usually moving. Drawn facing +x; the game flips it.",
